exports[`the admin Notifications page is unchanged with only the built-in channels > browser off: the events are greyed and the info alert shows 1`] = `"<div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthLg css-5c1adp-MuiContainer-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-8f57v9"><h1 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1it4a80-MuiTypography-root">Notifications</h1><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-9ebprp-MuiTypography-root">Turn browser notifications on or off for everyone, and suppress individual events.</p><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-rvp0cx-MuiPaper-root" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><div class="MuiBox-root css-0"><h6 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1wmifpn-MuiTypography-root">Browser notifications</h6><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox"><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Deliver browser notifications</span></label><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-1srf62h-MuiTypography-root">When off, no one receives browser notifications, whatever their own preferences say. Email is unaffected.</p><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivide