exports[`the preferences matrix is unchanged with only the built-in channels > browser capability ios-needs-install, push on 1`] = `"<div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiCard-root css-1j74uew-MuiPaper-root-MuiCard-root" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><div class="MuiCardContent-root css-1lt5qva-MuiCardContent-root"><h6 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1wmifpn-MuiTypography-root">Notifications</h6><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-956xpl-MuiTypography-root">Choose what reaches you, and how. Changes are saved as you make them.</p><div class="MuiBox-root css-1qm1lh"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAlert-root MuiAlert-colorInfo MuiAlert-standard css-k1p3sh-MuiPaper-root-MuiAlert-root" role="alert" style="--Paper-shadow: none;"><div class="MuiAlert-icon css-vab54s-MuiAlert-icon"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeInherit css-1ckov0h-MuiSvgIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="InfoOutlinedIcon"><path d="M11,9H13V7H11M12,20C7.59,20 4,16.41 4,12C4,7.59 7.59,4 12,4C16.41,4 20,7.59 20, 12C20,16.41 16.41,20 12,20M12,2A10,10 0 0,0 2,12A10,10 0 0,0 12,22A10,10 0 0,0 22,12A10, 10 0 0,0 12,2M11,17H13V11H11V17Z"></path></svg></div><div class="MuiAlert-message css-zioonp-MuiAlert-message"><div class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiTypography-gutterBottom MuiAlertTitle-root css-5ick94-MuiTypography-root-MuiAlertTitle-root">Add this app to your Home Screen</div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-19znlxf-MuiTypography-root">iOS and iPadOS permit web notifications only for an app added to the Home Screen — never for a page open in an ordinary Safari tab, no matter what permission you grant there. Add it once, then open the app from its Home Screen icon to 